# Piece 13: the core's pictures of a page a turn changed, under the reply, and the lead's result
# row for its worker. @Wren starts the site, then changes the invoice page twice; each change is
# applied mid-turn, so the core sees it as Wren's, and takes the page at three widths at the end.
stage 1760 1000
window 1760 1000
replies pictures.json
prefer themeId aura-noir
project storefront shop-site
chat Kai
title "Invoices"
settle 4
say "keep an eye on @Wren's invoice work"
hold 4
chat Wren
title "Bank transfer on the invoice page"
lead Kai
settle 3
say "start the site"
hold 6
say "add the card option to the invoice page"
wait 2
patch site-v1.diff
hold 14
say "add bank transfer to the invoice page, with the account details"
wait 2
patch site-v2.diff
hold 16
settle 2
snap worker-pictures
front Kai
settle 3
snap lead-result
click 871,906
type "on it" 80
click 640,495
type " a" 80
click 1185,495
settle 6
type " b" 80
wait 1
snap lead-tried
front Wren
settle 4
snap worker-desk
end
